<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><base href="<?=e($base)?>"><title>Cartas AR para imprimir — ARCANA</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/app.css"><style>body{padding:30px}.print-header{max-width:900px;margin:auto auto 28px}.print-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}.print-card{background:white;color:#111;padding:18px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #bbb;border-radius:8px;break-inside:avoid}.print-card img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1}.print-card h2{font-size:17px;margin:8px}.print-card small{display:block}@media(max-width:600px){.print-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media print{body{background:white;padding:0}.print-header button,.print-header a{display:none}.print-header{color:black}.print-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8mm}.print-card{width:55mm;border-radius:0;padding:5mm}.print-card img{width:50mm;height:50mm}.print-card h2{font-size:11pt}}</style></head><body><div class="print-header"><a href="./">← Voltar à arena</a><h1>Leve suas criaturas para a mesa.</h1><p>Imprima em papel fosco, escala 100%, sem cortar a borda preta. Cada marcador mede 5 cm. Use boa iluminação e mantenha a carta inteira na câmera. O código identifica a carta; a invocação na partida continua sujeita às regras do servidor.</p><button class="button button-gold" id="print-button">Imprimir seis cartas</button></div><div class="print-grid"><?php foreach($cards as $card):?><article class="print-card"><img src="markers/<?=e($card['slug'])?>.svg" alt="Marcador de <?=e($card['name'])?>"><h2><?=e($card['name'])?></h2><small>ATK <?=e($card['attack'])?> · DEF <?=e($card['defense'])?> · HP <?=e($card['hp'])?></small><small>ARCANA / <?=e($card['element'])?></small></article><?php endforeach;?></div><script>document.getElementById('print-button').onclick=()=>window.print()</script></body></html>
